#: cache.cpp:257
msgid ""
"This module lets you configure your cache settings. The cache is an internal "
"memory in Konqueror where recently read web pages are stored. If you want to "
"retrieve a web page again that you have recently read, it will not be "
"downloaded from the net, but rather retrieved from the cache which is a lot "
"faster."
msgstr ""
"Module na`y cho phe'p ba.n ca^'u hi`nh thie^'t la^.p cache . Cache la` 1 loa.i"
"bo^. nho+' trong Konquerror no+i ma` ca'c trang web vu+`a xem se~ ddu+o+.c"
"giu+~ la.i . Ne^'u ba.n muo^'n nha^.n ca'c la.i ca'c trang web ma` ba.n vu+`a xem,"
"no' se~ ddu+o+.c ta?i la.i tu+` internet tha`y vi` la^'y ra tu+` cache"

